aughter","neighbours":["identity","circle","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Добрые вещи смеются у близкой цели и идут кривым путём.","en":"Good things laugh near their aim and take crooked paths."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3ed09aeff9f4dfadfe38007727c84720","tos.text-unit.sid-3ed09aeff9f4dfadfe38007727c84720"]},"form":"Lachenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"transforming-laughter","neighbours":["identity","difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель сам освящает свой смех венцом.","en":"The teacher sanctifies his own laughter with a crown."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-be0b9dba83166e88f6828bb80eca390a","tos.text-unit.sid-be0b9dba83166e88f6828bb80eca390a"]},"form":"Wahrlacher","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"transforming-laughter","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-20c2eaeeeb4ee35b175463b3edeccf3f","tos.text-unit.sid-20c2eaeeeb4ee35b175463b3edeccf3f"]},"form":"lachende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"transforming-laughter","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fa16e1802680816c74c483dc3db5a534","tos.text-unit.sid-fa16e1802680816c74c483dc3db5a534"]},"form":"lachen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"transforming-laughter","neighbours":["memory","dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель соединяет поднятые сердца, ноги и смех.","en":"The teacher joins raised hearts, feet and laughter."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-acb56e3a56cbf2a2c0075af4ae817762","tos.text-unit.sid-acb56e3a56cbf2a2c0075af4ae817762"]},"form":"Lachenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"h